pcapsipdump (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Repackage against upstream SVN r157 (the final SourceForge revision) with
    the pcap_dump_flush()/logging fixes from the jchavanton fork.
  * Replace the SysV init script with systemd units; the old scripts are kept
    in contrib/sysvinit for reference.
  * Add pcapsipdump-cleanup.timer, which finally makes the long-documented
    RETENTION setting do something.
  * Modernise packaging: debhelper-compat 13, dh sequencer instead of cdbs,
    hardening=+all.
  * Build .deb and .rpm packages from GitHub Actions.

 -- Denys Pozniak <denys.pozniak@gmail.com>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0200

